16. Qb8+ $3 { The queen gives check on b8 and invites the knight to leave d7. Calculate the rook entry before giving up the queen. } 16... Nxb8 { The knight takes the queen but vacates d7. This removes the last obstruction from the d-file. } 17. Rd8# { The rook reaches d8 with mate. The bishop on g5 protects d8, so the king cannot capture the rook. } *

